    "intro_narrative": "You are a rogue netrunner trapped in Sector 4 of the Chronos Mega-Corp facility after a botched data heist. The lockdown sirens wail, and the air smells heavily of ozone and cheap synth-caf. Neon lights flicker ominously overhead, casting long shadows across the server racks. Corporate enforcers are already sweeping the lower levels, giving you only minutes to act. Your only way out is to breach the sector's central system and extract the plain-text override files. To survive, you must scavenge the room, reactivate the dormant hardware, and daisy-chain their outputs to crack the lockdown.",
